: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">퇴사일시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: 2016. 12. 21(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) 14:00 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이전까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">퇴사절차</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -115pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">관생실 청소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">관생실 및 실내 화장실을 깨끗하게 청소하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">쓰레기는 분리수거한 뒤 퇴실하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -116pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">냉장고 비우기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">각 층에 비치된 공용 냉장고 내부의 개인 음식물을 모두</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">비움</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">퇴실 완료 후 냉장고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -116pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 내의 잔여 음식물은 모두 폐기 처리함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -151pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">시설 및 물품 점검 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">가구 위치가 변경되었거나 시설 및 물품이 분실 또는 파손되었을 시 개인이 책임지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -151pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 고 원상 복구해야함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><strong><u>문제가 있을 시 사전에 각 동 경비실로 알리기 바람</u></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">열쇠 반납</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">키 미반납시 재발급 비용 징수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">푸름관생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">푸름관 통합경비실</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-pad